      <subsection name="Description" id="EmptyLineWrappingInBlock_Description">
        <div>
          Checks the empty line right after the opening brace and right before the closing
          brace of a block.
        </div>

        <p>
          <code>topSeparator</code> controls the line after the opening brace and
          <code>bottomSeparator</code> controls the line before the closing brace.
          Both accept the following values:
        </p>
        <ul>
        <li><code>empty_line</code> - exactly one empty line is required;</li>
        <li><code>empty_line_allowed</code> - not validated, an empty line may be present or absent;</li>
        <li><code>no_empty_line</code> - an empty line is forbidden.</li>
        </ul>
      </subsection>

